            ><div class="ix36pwE1W6qzsunaX" data-instant-type="container"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iWbMJ0e0JHbT8ParS"
                ><p>🚭 6 Eye-Opening Reasons to Quit This Stoptober (That Have <em>Nothing</em> to Do with Willpower)</p></div
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iIyKIl7Hy0ySQted9"
                ><p><em>By Alan Carlsen, The Quitters Club</em></p></div
              ></div
            ></div
          ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i9q8h9NNPVT3icfFu"><p>Inspired by the insights of Allen Carr, author of the best-selling quit smoking book ever written, here are 6 truths every smoker needs to know before they try to quit, and why Stoptober is the perfect time to break free.</p></div
          ><a class="iZTCcFRNFKQglUOTV" data-instant-type="container" href="#iVJzCz1m1vEWRrltf" data-instant-action-type="scroll-to-section" data-instant-action-id="VJzCz1m1vEWRrltf"
