        ><div class="ijun5sMK4ef3eI3F1" data-instant-type="container"
          ><div class="iGpCmWPfsFJ0mLotO" data-instant-type="container"
            ><div class="iHTpjw3isNEZ6eIte" data-instant-type="container"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ivoulBK41eEW4vSd5"
                ><p><strong>If you think quitting smoking is hard, stressful, or only for the strong-willed, you’ve been lied to.</strong></p></div
              ></div
            ></div
          ><div class="iintB3hz8cNNwzr8U" data-instant-type="container"
            ><div class="iTcwES8srGsnwMCgK" data-instant-type="container"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iVV848xX5DZwZ8N98"
                ><p>This Stoptober, it’s time to clear the smoke around quitting and show you the truth:</p><p></p><p>🚫 Quitting doesn’t need to feel like a loss. </p><p>🚫 You don’t need to suffer. </p><p>🚫 You don’t need willpower.</p><p></p><p>Inspired by <em>Allen Carr’s Easyway</em>, the method that’s helped <strong>millions</strong> quit smoking <em>without pain or stress</em>, here are <strong>6 truths</strong> every smoker deserves to know, and one natural tool that could help you quit <em>for good</em>.</p></div
              ></div
            ></div
          ><a class="inowIkRii4Md8DIPB" data-instant-type="container" href="#iVJzCz1m1vEWRrltf" data-instant-action-type="scroll-to-section" data-instant-action-id="VJzCz1m1vEWRrltf"
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iluYMxkus2cCDuwsn"
              ><p><strong>Show Me The Reasons</strong></p></div
            ><div class="iFDxOuQ8ihQgumhGJ" data-instant-type="container"
              ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="irkuczTR6q7iVwBHV">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                  <title>arrow-right</title><path d="M224.49,136.49l-72,72a12,12,0,0,1-17-17L187,140H40a12,12,0,0,1,0-24H187L135.51,64.48a12,12,0,0,1,17-17l72,72A12,12,0,0,1,224.49,136.49Z"></path>
