            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iUJRKxtrISeCe76MS"><p>.01</p></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iE6XnUE0yIiVkdIV9"
              ><p>🧠 You Don’t <em>Need</em> Willpower</p></div
            ></div
          ><div class="iHqLLtU869gy30zCI" data-instant-type="container"
            ><div class="ikbzQ1Q6F3Z2NFxfh" data-instant-type="container"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iVOWaljYsVsg9F4mS"
                ><p>Most people fail to quit because they believe they’re &#8220;giving something up.&#8221; But what if smoking doesn’t <em>give</em> anything to begin with? No real comfort. No stress relief. No actual pleasure, just a short fix to stop the discomfort it caused.</p><p></p><p><strong>Carr’s method proves: once you see smoking gives nothing, you stop wanting it at all.</strong></p></div
              ><a class="iDYIEhHyYXZLmNdVH" data-instant-type="container" href="#iPPV0aEZ2fyC3kn2c" data-instant-action-type="scroll-to-section" data-instant-action-id="PPV0aEZ2fyC3kn2c"
                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iCDytCJEoP8pVG5sL"><p>Next Reason </p></div
                ><div class="ie2L9z0G66yNoe50k" data-instant-type="container"
                  ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iAkzLZPTs6HSnwxWF">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                      <title>arrow-right</title><path d="M224.49,136.49l-72,72a12,12,0,0,1-17-17L187,140H40a12,12,0,0,1,0-24H187L135.51,64.48a12,12,0,0,1,17-17l72,72A12,12,0,0,1,224.49,136.49Z"></path>
