          ><div class="iYV6tIqsE4e7Y2D90" data-instant-type="container"
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iytxF6G2n9S576HFx"><p>.03</p></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text igT2TyU2RzShkgw6t"
              ><p>⚠️ <strong>&#8220;Cutting Down&#8221; Makes It Harder</strong></p></div
            ></div
          ><div class="ilJ6bcniOE7m4ePJX" data-instant-type="container"
