            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i9mmSHSgnn9HYSea6"><p>.04</p></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text igR8tPm9bgb57RKEw"
              ><p>🚫 <strong>&#8220;Just One&#8221; Is How It Starts Again</strong></p></div
            ></div
          ><div class="iZWbGbAh0aBnjcXf2" data-instant-type="container"
            ><div class="iRGpHsXef8bNtt4DQ" data-instant-type="container"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iYldv8hjgdfayEoEU"
                ><p>You quit. Then you have one at a party. One turns into three. Then it’s back to the shop. Sound familiar? That’s not failure — that’s the power of nicotine addiction. And it doesn’t take much to reignite it.</p><p><strong>Protect your quit. One puff is all it takes to undo progress.</strong></p></div
              ><a class="isG2MuwGseb4wdoXD" data-instant-type="container" href="#iptOYOEL9uKWlkPfN" data-instant-action-type="scroll-to-section" data-instant-action-id="ptOYOEL9uKWlkPfN"
                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iIy4XuYvAp8jn4Zln"
