          ><div class="igJ7aEcU4RDUt2WL9" data-instant-type="container"
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iMTIe1zcn8bTs8ORM"><p>.05</p></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text idEMrw1t87K0Xt2w1"
              ><p>💨 <strong>Most Quit Aids Keep You Addicted</strong></p></div
            ></div
          ><div class="icN5bWbdCSV7RLovM" data-instant-type="container"
            ><div class="iS0NzVeELDo6o6bbQ" data-instant-type="container"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iRtS3eShungOIm8eZ"
                ><p>Patches, gum, vapes, they still feed you nicotine. That means you’re not actually quitting, you’re just switching brands. The addiction stays. The habit stays. Only the packaging changes.</p><p></p><p><strong>Freedom starts when you remove nicotine completely, not when you change the format.</strong></p></div
