              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iiQYu4YcnOrgb0eNS"
                ><p>You don’t need to &#8220;earn&#8221; your non-smoker badge. You don’t have to count the days or wait to feel free. The moment you stop, that’s it. You’re already there. No more cravings, no more rituals, no more doubt.</p><p></p><p><strong>Start seeing yourself as smoke-free now, because you are.</strong></p></div
